### Install official Cqrlog (2.5.2 together with MariaDB) to Ubuntu 26.04 and optionally upgrade it to latest CqrlogImproved

"install_Ubuntu_cqrlog.zip" holds script "install_cqrlog.sh" that has been tested with Ubuntu 26.04 in Oracle virtual machine.
Download, unzip and start it in command console to install Cqrlog (without loadng it from Ubuntu's faulty install packet). 
Installing is tested several times to plain XUbuntu 26.04, but no quarantee is given.

In any case Ubuntu can not wait long enough when Cqrlog is creating first log and will prompt you that cqrlog is not resoponding.
Press "wait" or do nothing if this happens while creating first log at beginning.


